{
 "description": "Recommended paid pre-action check ($1). Before an autonomous agent spends money, shares non-public data, delegates authority, or creates external side effects, create an unpaid GovOmniAI Agent Action Assurance Check order. It returns an assurance tier, evidence sufficiency, missing/weak evidence, risk factors, and whether a human gate is warranted. The result is sealed before payment. This tool does not charge the buyer; it returns the MPP payment endpoint, order token, terms, and status URL so the independently authorized buyer agent decides whether to pay.",
